    "description": "Library or school, level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). Over budget: 469 blocks vs 310 (first build 394 vs 260). Stone reading hall whose front rises into a great round window over the door; book stacks stand out from both walls between the windows, a reading table down the middle, hearth, archive and scribe's desk at the back; L2 fills the stacks with bookshelves and adds the lectern, candles, lanterns, banners, shutters and flower boxes; L3 carpets, a globe and map table, a bench, flowers, vines and a lantern post.",
